WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.040
Welcome to my ultimate Gitmastery course.

00:04.040 --> 00:07.200
Over the next five hours, you're going to learn everything you need to know to use Git

00:07.200 --> 00:09.680
like a pro and work effectively with others.

00:09.680 --> 00:14.120
We're going to start off by talking about the fundamental concepts like what is Git,

00:14.120 --> 00:17.760
how to install and configure it, and then in each section, we're going to explore a

00:17.760 --> 00:19.360
different set of Git tools.

00:19.360 --> 00:24.520
We'll cover creating snapshots of your code, browsing your project history, branching and

00:24.520 --> 00:28.480
merging, collaborating with others using GitHub, and rewriting history.

00:28.480 --> 00:31.400
I'm Mosh Hamidani and I'm super excited to be your instructor.

00:31.400 --> 00:32.840
Now let's jump in and get started.

